<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-day bill yield flat, longer dates fall.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-day bill yield flat, longer dates fall.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills was unchanged at 25.25 percent on Tuesday from the previous auction on January 14, a national bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 26.51 percent from 29.73 percent. The yield on 182-day T-bills fell to 31.30 percent from 35.11 percent at the previous auction on January 4.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				Jan 21	   Jan 14</p>
<p> Issue volume	     3.00 million lei   3.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations	    1,000 lei	1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand	   3.24 million	 3.41 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		3.00 million	 3.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			25.25 pct	25.25 pct</p>
<p> Price			98.1 pct	 98.1 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids	    98.1-98.5 pct  98.1-98.5 pct</p>
<p> Maturity		   Feb 20, 1997   Feb 13, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				Jan 21	   Jan 14</p>
<p> Issue volume	     12.00 million lei  14.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations	    1,000 lei	1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand	   18.74 million	21.91 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		12.00 million	14.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			26.51 pct	29.73 pct</p>
<p> Price			93.8 pct	 93.1 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids	    93.8-94.7 pct  93.1-95.0 pct</p>
<p> Maturity		   Apr 24, 1997   Apr 17, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 182-day paper auction:</p>
<p>				Jan 21	   Jan 4</p>
<p> Issue volume	     3.00 million lei   3.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations	    1,000 lei	1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand	   8.95 million	 3.29 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		3.00 million	 3.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			31.30 pct	35.11 pct</p>
<p> Price			86.5 pct	 85.1 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids	    86.5-90.0 pct  85.1-88.0 pct</p>
<p> Maturity		   July 24, 1997  July 10, 1997</p>
